ied."},"id":"pems:proposition:1f8d3f09893f08d6726c7510","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:06fcf7cef7082069ef2852a9"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The Distiller core derives a candidate submission ID deterministically from the invocation identifier and canonical candidate graph bytes."},"id":"pems:proposition:2805c369a7e1bd9a07926d23","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:d1478771e5e7d09f66ce102c"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The project bootstrap runtime recognizes both the exact legacy reasoning-distiller-project/1 configuration and the reasoning-distiller-project/2 identity contract."},"id":"pems:proposition:2b72b7deaa9462c7c145f6d1","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:06fcf7cef7082069ef2852a9"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The Rupi lifecycle adapter composes installer, bootstrap, status, and recovery primitives and states that it owns no installer, lifecycle, authority, or intent semantics."},"id":"pems:proposition:3775dfb65823362d048b1a90","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:a2312493568a8bb713733802"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The Distiller core validates that every provenance source referenced by a model candidate exists in the supplied source registry before submission."},"id":"pems:proposition:46aa436f5296d96fc45050e9","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:d1478771e5e7d09f66ce102c"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The Distiller core states and implements no model execution, admission, canonical mutation, o