proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The Distiller entrypoint determines source type from the explicit ingestion selection and documents that deterministic source-ID spelling is bookkeeping rather than an authority source."},"id":"pems:proposition:9bc83e514e2a57cc754bd01a","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:5ca3eef20645eec1e05608b5"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The current Distiller entrypoint is a compatibility adapter over rd_distill_core.py that adds explicit governed_artifact source selection and reasoning-distiller-project/2 configuration support."},"id":"pems:proposition:9f3f49f588f2b2136e5aa850","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:5ca3eef20645eec1e05608b5"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"Rupi checkpoint completion is derived from exact primitive result statuses and final Human control return is routed through the accepted human-agent control-return primitive."},"id":"pems:proposition:b3028f5bd6293f8720d862b4","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:deb7f2960909855b570a91f9"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The v2 bootstrap runtime requires project identity to contain exactly non-empty id, name, repository, and summary fields and does not derive those values from repository state."},"id":"pems:proposition:b98458431bee2b5169000325","kind":"proposition","lifecycle":"current","provenance":{"primary":["pems:source_observation:06fcf7cef7082069ef2852a9"]}},{"data":{"epistemic_role":"asserted","proposition_kind":"observation","statement":"The install-recovery adapter exposes interrupted-install recovery as a bounded primitive and normalizes recovery success or failure into reasoning-distiller-install-recovery-result/1."},"id":"pems:p